    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Upon arrival, the vehicle is examined in natural daylight to reveal any surface damage, scratches, dents, or paint discrepancies that may have been concealed in low‑light conditions. The inspector compares the live view with the original pickup photographs, noting any variations on a standardized condition report.</p>
