    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Odometer verification against the LR bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The displayed odometer reading is read directly from the instrument cluster and cross‑checked with the mileage recorded on the Lorry Receipt (LR) bilty. Any deviation beyond the permitted tolerance (typically ±5 km) triggers an investigation. The verified reading is entered into the handover log, and a copy of the LR bilty is stamped and retained as proof that the vehicle’s mileage was not altered during transit.</p>
